# Copy the name, not this file, into Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment
# Variables. Never commit the real key.
#
# Locally (PowerShell, in this folder, before `node server.js`):
#   $env:HENRIK_API_KEY = "HDEV-..."
#
# Get a key from https://api.henrikdev.xyz/dashboard (Discord sign-in). The free
